        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">As per <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3787704279\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42655\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/42655/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42655\">#42655</a> and <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3787633040\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42654\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/42654/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42654\">#42654</a>, there are inconsistencies between the finished example screenshots and the live code.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR resolves the issue by replacing the screenshots with live samples to ensure consistency.</p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #42655.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3787704279\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42655\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/42655/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42655\">#42655</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #42654.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3787633040\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42654\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/42654/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42654\">#42654</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n",
