        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">COOP uses the reporting API to report violations. This adds docs.</p>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> COOPViolationReportBody - report structure for COOP violations</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Update Reporting API docs everywhere to include links to these</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy - add report-to</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy-Report-Only - add report-to</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> BCD everywhere <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3132335736\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27021\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27021/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27021\">mdn/browser-compat-data#27021</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Note, <a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/39880/files#r2425080573\">https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/39880/files#r2425080573</a> :</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">COEP reports are visible to reporting observers.<br>\nCOOP property access reports are also visible to reporting observers. The navigation ones are not.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Also data mine or integrate with <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3652702395\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42051\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/42051/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42051\">#42051</a> and see if there is anything additional to capture from <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3132245291\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/39880\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/39880/hovercard?comment_id=2151383496&amp;comment_type=review_comment\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/39880#discussion_r2151383496\">#39880 (comment)</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #39814.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3123648843\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/39814\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/39814/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/39814\">#39814</a></p>",
