            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">This expands on the concept of Indirect injection sinks with a real example. Note that I haven't tried to list all the alternatives, just explained that TT does deal with these cases.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/fred-wang/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/fred-wang\">@fred-wang</a> If you have bandwidth, would appreciate your sanity check. This fall out of our discussion in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1928932#c22\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1928932#c22</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2770544982\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/37518\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/37518/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/37518\">#37518</a> and <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3510273732\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41507\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/41507/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41507\">#41507</a></p>",
