        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169522277?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">This PR fixes an incorrect regex modifier syntax in the \"Types\" table<br>\non the Groups and Backreferences guide.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The modifier group was incorrectly shown as <code class=\"notranslate\">(?:flags-flags:x)</code>,<br>\nwhich does not apply flags. The correct syntax is <code class=\"notranslate\">(?flags-flags:x)</code>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #42609.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3777384005\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42609\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/42609/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42609\">#42609</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42610",
            "title": "Fix incorrect modifier syntax in Groups and Backreferences table",
            "date_modified": "2026-01-03T05:47:22.000Z",
